arm64: dts: qcom: sc7280: mark the venus node dma-coherent

Per the Aug 2026 iris series (Vishnu Reddy): the VPU DSP does its own
cache maintenance; missing coherency caused hardware faults on input
and corruption of captured output at higher resolutions. Not yet in
torvalds/linux at 7.3-rc1, so carried here.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7280.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7280.dtsi
index d8a1130..321fbfe 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7280.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc7280.dtsi
@@ -4680,6 +4680,9 @@
 			iommus = <&apps_smmu 0x2180 0x20>;
 			memory-region = <&video_mem>;
 
+			/* VPU DSP does its own cache maintenance (Aug 2026 iris series) */
+			dma-coherent;
+
 			status = "disabled";
 
 			venus_opp_table: opp-table {
